173 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (If you are reading this, your organization has many BI tools across the enterprise. Too many. This proliferation creates redundant costs, inconsistent reporting, and unnecessary complexity, but forcing standardization on a single platform often fails. At the same time, many organizations are adopting self-service analytics, with some moving beyond traditional enterprise BI platforms. This adds another layer of complexity to BI consolidation, making it clear that there is no one-size-fits-all solution.)
/E (If you are reading this, your organization has many BI tools across the enterprise. Too many. This proliferation creates redundant costs, inconsistent reporting, and unnecessary complexity, but forcing standardization on a single platform often fails. At the same time, many organizations are adopting self-service analytics, with some moving beyond traditional enterprise BI platforms. This adds another layer of complexity to BI consolidation, making it clear that there is no one-size-fits-all solution.)
/Pg 9 0 R
>>
endobj
