/T (This guide outlines a practical roadmap for transforming your fragmented BI landscape into a coherent, cost-effective analytics ecosystem that satisfies both IT governance requirements and business user needs. We will guide you through assessment, architecture design, implementation planning, and change management to ensure successful adoption across your organization.)
