<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Successful BI consolidation initiatives balance multiple objectives that extend beyond simple cost reduction. While decreasing license, support, and infrastructure spending remains a primary goal, equally important is enhancing governance through standardized definitions and centralized management. This creates a trusted foundation of metrics and calculations that all business users can rely on.)
/E (Successful BI consolidation initiatives balance multiple objectives that extend beyond simple cost reduction. While decreasing license, support, and infrastructure spending remains a primary goal, equally important is enhancing governance through standardized definitions and centralized management. This creates a trusted foundation of metrics and calculations that all business users can rely on.)
/Pg 11 0 R
>>
endobj
194 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Consolidation also drives business agility by allowing organizations to implement changes to data models, logic, or metrics once and have them instantly reflected across all analytics platforms. Support teams benefit from focusing their expertise on fewer technologies, creating deeper knowledge and faster issue resolution. Throughout the consolidation process, maintaining user satisfaction and productivity remains essential. Even the most advanced technical solutions will struggle if business users resit adoption or cannot access the insights they need.)
/E (Consolidation also drives business agility by allowing organizations to implement changes to data models, logic, or metrics once and have them instantly reflected across all analytics platforms. Support teams benefit from focusing their expertise on fewer technologies, creating deeper knowledge and faster issue resolution. Throughout the consolidation process, maintaining user satisfaction and productivity remains essential. Even the most advanced technical solutions will struggle if business users resit adoption or cannot access the insights they need.)
/Pg 11 0 R
>>
