<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Our experience reveals that successful consolidations don't simply eliminate tools; they thoughtfully rebuild the analytics foundation to balance governance with flexibility. The following three-tiered approach provides a blueprint for reducing costs while enhancing analytics capabilities across your enterprise. )
/E (Our experience reveals that successful consolidations don't simply eliminate tools; they thoughtfully rebuild the analytics foundation to balance governance with flexibility. The following three-tiered approach provides a blueprint for reducing costs while enhancing analytics capabilities across your enterprise. )
/Pg 14 0 R
