/E (One leading platform that exemplifies this approach is Strategy Mosaic, which offers these capabilities through its universal semantic layer with AI-assisted modeling, broad data connectivity, and vendor-neutral design. By aligning this neutral layer with both BI and AI capabilities, Strategy Mosaic provides a scalable foundation for both human-driven analytics and AI-powered decision making.)
/Pg 15 0 R
>>
