318 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Enterprise platforms must scale to support thousands of users simultaneously while processing complex calculations against large datasets. They require flexible deployment options, including containerization for modern infrastructure environments and typically offer embedded analytics capabilities for integrating insights directly into operational applications and workflows. Strategy One exemplifies an enterprise analytics platform with these capabilities, providing the performance, governance, and scalability needed for organization-wide reporting and analytics delivery.)
/E (Enterprise platforms must scale to support thousands of users simultaneously while processing complex calculations against large datasets. They require flexible deployment options, including containerization for modern infrastructure environments and typically offer embedded analytics capabilities for integrating insights directly into operational applications and workflows. Strategy One exemplifies an enterprise analytics platform with these capabilities, providing the performance, governance, and scalability needed for organization-wide reporting and analytics delivery.)
/Pg 16 0 R
>>
