<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (While the consolidation strategy aims to reduce redundancy, we also acknowledge that certain self-service tools deliver unique value to specific user communities. Rather than forcing all users onto a single platform, which often creates resistance and workarounds, successful consolidation initiatives strategically retain select tools where they serve legitimate business needs. )
/E (While the consolidation strategy aims to reduce redundancy, we also acknowledge that certain self-service tools deliver unique value to specific user communities. Rather than forcing all users onto a single platform, which often creates resistance and workarounds, successful consolidation initiatives strategically retain select tools where they serve legitimate business needs. )
/Pg 16 0 R
>>
