<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (By implementing a universal semantic layer approach, you can achieve immediate cost savings while preserving analytics capabilities across your enterprise. This foundation of consistent business definitions connects to both your enterprise reporting systems and selected self-service tools, giving you the governance benefits of standardization while maintaining the flexibility your business users need. The shift to a universal semantic layer does not create net new operational burdens; rather, it enables organizations to redirect existing investments in redundant management towards unified, business-enabling governance.)
/E (By implementing a universal semantic layer approach, you can achieve immediate cost savings while preserving analytics capabilities across your enterprise. This foundation of consistent business definitions connects to both your enterprise reporting systems and selected self-service tools, giving you the governance benefits of standardization while maintaining the flexibility your business users need. The shift to a universal semantic layer does not create net new operational burdens; rather, it enables organizations to redirect existing investments in redundant management towards unified, business-enabling governance.)
/Pg 20 0 R
>>
